TI  - Harnessing endophytic fungi for sustainable agriculture: ecological roles, mechanisms, and future prospects
AN  - 41883795
DO  - 10.3389/fmicb.2026.1710071
VL  - 17
DA  - 2026
PY  - 2026
T2  - Frontiers in microbiology
J2  - Front Microbiol
SN  - 1664-302X
