TI  - Invasion success of a widespread invasive predator may be explained by a high predatory efficacy but may be influenced by pathogen infection
AN  - IND606746214
DO  - 10.1007/s10530-019-02067-w
IS  - 12
VL  - 21
DA  - 2019/12
PY  - 2019
JO  - Biological invasions
J2  - Biol Invasions
